# Rust / Tauri
/target
/src-tauri/target
/src-tauri/gen/
/src-tauri/icons/android/
/src-tauri/icons/ios/
**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed: this is an application workspace.

# Node / Vite (once scaffolded)
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
*.local

# Lore local data (NEVER commit — may contain sensitive indexed content)
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
/blobs/
/exports/
/logs/

# Fixtures: commit ONLY anonymized fixtures under src-tauri/fixtures/.
# Never commit raw agent sessions or real ~/.claude / ~/.codex data.
/scratch/
*.real.jsonl

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp

# Env / secrets (signing, notarization) — never commit
.env
.env.*
*.p12
*.provisionprofile

# Documentation.
#
# Contributor-essential docs ARE tracked: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, docs/DOCS_INDEX.md,
# and docs/{architecture,agents,development}. Someone cloning this repository needs
# them to build correctly, and AGENTS.md is referenced as the canonical contributor
# guide, so it has to exist in a fresh clone.
#
# These stay local-only. This repository is public; product strategy, unshipped
# design, decision rationale, and competitor research are not published.
/docs/product/
/docs/design/
/docs/decisions/
/docs/research/
/RESEARCH_SUMMARY.md

# Working logs and scratch notes — long, machine-generated, not part of the project.
/AUDIT_LOG.md
/POLISH_LOG.md
/audit-goal.txt

# Local agent instructions and design previews
/.claude/
/preview.html
/src/preview.tsx
